UID:37745825d05ab67297910aa1af5ae0c8bdd899ff@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260915T220442Z
DTSTART:20260917T220000Z
DTEND:20260918T000000Z
SUMMARY:Ty Burr's Film Club: The Godfather
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Francis Ford Coppola's epic masterpiece features Marlon Brando 
 in his Oscar©-winning role as the patriarch of the Corleone family. Direc
 tor Coppola paints a chilling portrait of the Sicilian clan's rise and nea
 r fall from power in America\, masterfully balancing the story between the
  Corleone's family life and the ugly crime business in which they are enga
 ged. Based on Mario Puxo's best-selling novel and featuring career-making 
 performances by Al Pacino\, James Cann and Robert Duvall\, this searing an
 d brilliant film garnered ten Academy Award® nominations\, and won three 
 including Best Picture of 1972.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/ty
 -burrs-film-club-the-godfather\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
 boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/ty-burrs-film-club-the-godfather
END:VEVENT
