UID:82978aefaa19bcff5b5e6885d67aa192182e73f3@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260915T220442Z
DTSTART:20260923T223000Z
DTEND:20260924T003000Z
SUMMARY:Behind the Screen: Baby Doe
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Thirty years ago\, Gail Ritchey\, a young woman from a conserva
 tive Christian community in rural Ohio\, had a stillborn birth alone and l
 eft the evidence in the woods. Now a devoted mother of three\, her quiet s
 uburban life is shattered when DNA evidence links her to the infamous cold
  case of “Geauga’s Child\,” leading to her arrest for murder. Facing
  a possible life sentence\, Gail must confront the weight of societal and 
 religious pressures—and her own long-buried shame—to ﬁght for her fr
 eedom.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/behind-the-screen-baby-doe\
 nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/behind-the-screen-baby-doe
END:VEVENT
