SUMMARY:BrainStorm
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:BrainStorm follows six compelling people living with bipolar on
  their journeys from devastation to recovery. The film connects their expe
 riences with the latest bipolar brain science to shed light on potential c
 auses and successful treatments. The film closes with a message of hope\, 
 showing that it is possible to thrive while living on the bipolar spectrum
 .\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/brainstorm\nFrom Pushpin Boston:
  https://pushpin.city/boston/
