SUMMARY:Au Revoir les Enfants
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:In 1943\, Julien is a student at a French boarding school. When
  three new students arrive\, including Jean Bonnet\, Julien believes they 
 are no different from the other boys. What Julien doesn't know is that the
  boys are actually Jews who are evading capture by the Nazis. While Julien
  doesn't care for Jean at first\, the boys develop a tight bond -- while t
 he head of the school\, Père Jean\, works to protect the boys from the Ho
 locaust.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/au-revoir-les-enfants\nFr
 om Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
